We could do girls versus boys.

00:33:31.280 --> 00:33:33.525
It could be so like,
I don't want to be,

00:33:33.525 --> 00:33:35.900
and then, you don't want to
be my-- you know what I mean?

00:33:35.900 --> 00:33:37.274
Put your hand in
the air if you'd

00:33:37.274 --> 00:33:40.140
