00:35:05.655 --> 00:35:08.649
I'm not the person you've
been searching for.

00:35:08.649 --> 00:35:11.552
So go and knock on
someone else's door.

00:35:11.552 --> 00:35:13.310
Because I don't want
to listen anymore.

00:35:13.310 --> 00:35:14.296
Oh yeah.

00:35:17.750 --> 00:35:22.267
You say that I'm
lost and you can

00:35:22.267 --> 00:35:33.113
help me find that I don't
want to be a savior no more.

00:35:33.113 --> 00:35:39.029
I wish you could tell me
something to change my mind.

00:35:39.029 --> 00:35:42.480
But you don't want
to be my savior.

00:35:42.480 --> 00:35:44.945
[SCATTING]

00:35:44.945 --> 00:35:49.130
The way he performs
is enthralling.

00:35:49.130 --> 00:35:52.100
I can't even begin to
imagine his potential.

00:35:52.100 --> 00:35:56.030
I mean, he's only, what, 22?

00:35:56.030 --> 00:35:59.606
I just think all of us
are so incredibly lucky.

