01:16:59.380 --> 01:17:10.778
Oh Danny Boy, Danny
Boy, I love you so

01:17:37.034 --> 01:17:51.200
Oh, Danny Boy, I love you so

01:19:22.875 --> 01:19:39.276
Take me anywhere you want to go

01:19:44.900 --> 01:19:51.519
You know my love is strong

01:19:51.519 --> 01:19:57.928
And my heart

01:20:06.350 --> 01:20:17.943
[? Softly, ?] [? softly, ?]
