01:20:17.943 --> 01:20:27.883
I've been searching all along

01:20:27.883 --> 01:20:35.338
For my heart, where it is

01:20:46.769 --> 01:20:53.727
Here it comes

01:20:53.727 --> 01:21:01.182
Darling we don't always far away

